    "text": "Now say by the rule of 3: if 22 of a circle gives me a diameter of 7, what will 10 of a circle give me? Operate and you will find that it will give you 3 and 4/22. Therefore, when the wheel of the cart has made a complete turn, it will have measured 10 arms of land, that is, 1/300 of a mile, which is 3,000 arms, and the wheel m will have only traveled the space of one of its teeth, which wheel has 300 teeth."
