    "domain": "art",
    "text": "(Right from top to bottom:) On the first day of January 1493. Why a perfect circle will be made without a sixth when it is made small, as they are made for writers. And if these writers wanted to make this letter large and of a perfect circle, a sixth would be needed. The toothed wheels do not exert the same force in turning as they exert on their wheels."
